# =====================================
#  clang-format configuration (LLVM+)
# =====================================

### Basis & Meta Preferences ###
BasedOnStyle: LLVM

### Indentation Rules ###
IndentWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
NamespaceIndentation: All

# Controls offset of access modifiers (-2 = compact)
AccessModifierOffset: -2

### Line Handling ###
ColumnLimit: 200

# Parameter wrapping policies
AllowAllParametersOfDeclarationOnNextLine: false
BinPackParameters: false

# Operator wrapping rules
BreakBeforeBinaryOperators: All

### Code Alignment ###
AlignConsecutiveAssignments: true
AlignConsecutiveDeclarations: true
AlignAfterOpenBracket: AlwaysBreak

### Pointer Style ###
PointerAlignment: Right

### Brace Handling ###
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach  # K&R style brace attachment

### Initializer Formatting ###
ConstructorInitializerIndentWidth: 4
